In ancient [[Fondent]], four legendary leaders embodied the spirits of [[Riagal]], [[Magjestic]], [[Forighness]], and [[Sovereice]]. Their reign was a golden age of human-Tuxemon harmony. A cataclysmic war forced them to seal the spirits, plunging the world into chaos. Legend holds that when darkness threatens once more, the Sovereigns will return, and a new champion will arise.